1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,923
Is this Black Friday deal

2
00:00:01,923 --> 00:00:03,077
real, or fake?

3
00:00:03,077 --> 00:00:04,615
One prompt tells you.

4
00:00:04,915 --> 00:00:06,069
Here's the trick.

5
00:00:06,069 --> 00:00:08,377
Some stores raise
the "was" price

6
00:00:08,377 --> 00:00:10,685
a few weeks before the sale,

7
00:00:10,685 --> 00:00:12,608
so the discount looks huge.

8
00:00:12,908 --> 00:00:15,215
In the EU, that old price

9
00:00:15,215 --> 00:00:17,138
must be the lowest price

10
00:00:17,138 --> 00:00:19,062
from the last 30 days.

11
00:00:19,062 --> 00:00:20,985
Not every shop plays fair.

12
00:00:21,285 --> 00:00:22,823
So copy this prompt

13
00:00:22,823 --> 00:00:24,362
into any free chatbot

14
00:00:24,362 --> 00:00:26,285
that can search the web.

15
00:00:26,585 --> 00:00:28,123
Paste the product link,

16
00:00:28,123 --> 00:00:29,277
the sale price

17
00:00:29,277 --> 00:00:30,815
and the "was" price.

18
00:00:31,115 --> 00:00:33,038
It looks up recent prices,

19
00:00:33,038 --> 00:00:34,577
checks two other stores,

20
00:00:34,577 --> 00:00:36,115
and gives a verdict:

21
00:00:36,115 --> 00:00:37,654
real deal, fake discount,

22
00:00:37,654 --> 00:00:38,808
or not sure.

23
00:00:39,108 --> 00:00:41,031
Here, it says not sure:

24
00:00:41,031 --> 00:00:42,569
no price history found.

25
00:00:42,569 --> 00:00:44,492
That's a reason to wait.

26
00:00:44,792 --> 00:00:46,331
Always click the sources

27
00:00:46,331 --> 00:00:47,485
before you buy.

28
00:00:47,785 --> 00:00:48,938
Screenshot the prompt,

29
00:00:48,938 --> 00:00:51,246
and send it to the friend

30
00:00:51,246 --> 00:00:53,554
who's about to buy that TV.

31
00:00:53,854 --> 00:00:55,777
Follow for one AI shortcut

32
00:00:55,777 --> 00:00:56,777
a day.

